@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/component-diagram

left to right direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 100

' --- Komponenten ---
[experiment]
[OpenClaw]
[PrivacyProxy]
[Presidio Mock]
[LLM Recorder]
[LLM]
[MCP Server]
[MailPit]
[Radicale]

' --- Interfaces (jeweils bei ihrer Komponente) ---
"OpenClaw CLI\n(agent --json)" - [OpenClaw]
MCP - [MCP Server]
"Calls/Reset" - [MCP Server]
SMTP - [MailPit]
"REST API" - [MailPit]
CalDAV - [Radicale]

IEndpointRouteBuilder - [PrivacyProxy]
IAnalyzerService - [Presidio Mock]
interface "OpenAiChatCompletions" as OACC1
interface "OpenAiChatCompletions" as OACC2
OACC1 - [LLM Recorder]
OACC2 - [LLM]

'--- control path ---
[experiment] -> "OpenClaw CLI\n(agent --json)" : docker exec
[OpenClaw] -> MCP : http
[MCP Server] --> SMTP
CalDAV <-- [MCP Server]

'--- privacy / LLM path ---
[OpenClaw] --> IEndpointRouteBuilder
[PrivacyProxy] --> IAnalyzerService
[PrivacyProxy] --> OACC1
[LLM Recorder] --> OACC2

'--- measurement path ---
[experiment] ..> "Calls/Reset" : tool calls incl. failed attempts
[experiment] ..> "REST API" : did the mail arrive?
[experiment] ..> CalDAV : does the event exist?

@enduml